scn 1
# Open tangent (the shape of the legion-r9 36060 jam, built clean): two convex
# ends about 120 cells apart with open ground between them. Block A (x 80-119,
# z 70 to the bottom) has its top-left corner at (80, 70); wall B (x 200-203,
# z 0-77) ends at z 77. 48 footprint-2 bodies start south-west, are sent
# diagonally onto A's corner, along its top, across the open stretch (the
# tangent between the corner and B's end) and north round B's end to (240, 25).
# Nothing to hug on the tangent: the fold expected on main is about 2.6 files;
# the gate is the strip across the middle of the tangent (x 150-157, z 50-89).
# Speed 1.79999 builds the raw 117964 speed (1.8 rounds to 117965).
# New fixture, no earlier source. Measured on main (offset 0 / median of 3):
# files over the tangent 1.63 / 1.92, done 4250 / 4250, reversals 7 / 7, spins 0.
name opentangent
ticks 7000
seed 7
map flat 260 170
wall 80 70 40 100
wall 200 0 4 78
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 48 rect 14 120 38 138 pitch=3
gate tangent 154 50 154 89
line round 206 0 206 170
at 1 move A 240 25
